 by Google that custom trains on your uploaded documents to generate multi-format content and automate workflows. **Q: How is Notebook LM different from ChatGPT?** A: Notebook LM focuses on your specific sources and data, providing accurate, grounded insights rather than generic AI responses. **Q: What new features have been added recently?** A: Export to Docs/Sheets, AI-generated data tables, video overviews with customizable visual styles, deep research discover, multi-audio studio design, and extended chat prompt length for detailed personas. **Q: Who can benefit from Notebook LM?** A: Students, educators, content creators, marketers, business professionals, researchers, and anyone needing to organize, analyze, and repurpose large volumes of content. **Q: What is the AI Profit Boardroom?** A: A community and training platform offering coaching, custom AI workflows, prompt packs, and support to scale businesses with AI tools like Notebook LM. **Q: Can Notebook LM handle images and handwritten notes?** A: Yes, it uses OCR to extract text and context from images, enabling richer multimodal research and content creation. **Q: Is Notebook LM free?** A: Yes, core features are free with usage limits. Pro and Ultra subscriptions add higher limits, more sources, and premium capabilities. **Q: How do I get started quickly?** A: Upload a few relevant documents, generate a video or infographic, experiment with custom personas, and progressively build a content system using the 5-step source-stack-shape-style-share framework. **Q: Does Notebook LM support multiple languages?** A: Yes, especially with the new multi-audio studio design, users can create audio overviews in many languages and customize tone and length. **Q: Can I integrate Notebook LM outputs with SEO and web publishing?** A: Absolutely. Combine with Gemini AI for content and landing page creation, and Perplexity AI for real-time research to create SEO-optimized articles and media. --- ### Conclusion Notebook LM 