here you left off without losing context. Build custom personas that answer questions in your preferred tone and style. Interact with generated podcasts or video overviews, ask follow-up questions, and get detailed, structured responses. This is AI content creation and training on steroids — perfect for knowledge workers, educators, and marketers alike. - [02:59:43 → 03:10:29] **The Ultimate SEO & Content Creation Workflow: Perplexity + Notebook LM + Gemini** Combine Perplexity AI’s real-time web search with Notebook LM’s deep research and content generation, then use Gemini Canvas to build SEO-optimized landing pages — all in under an hour. This workflow finds keyword gaps, creates fully sourced blog posts, adds inline citations, generates social media captions, thumbnails, and even video teasers. You get professional SEO content that ranks, converts, and drives traffic — no agency needed. - [03:10:30 → 03:17:43] **Native Math Rendering with LaTeX: Nerds Rejoice** Notebook LM finally makes math look good! Upload messy LaTeX code or handwritten equations, and it renders them cleanly in flashcards, quizzes, and chat. No more ugly backslashes or confusing syntax. Perfect for students, educators, or anyone dealing with scientific content. This makes studying and teaching math way easier and less error-prone. - [03:17:44 → 03:25:02] **Studio Design: Multiple Audio Versions in Different Languages & Tones** The new Notebook LM mobile app lets you create multiple audio overviews per notebook — in different languages, lengths, and tones — all from the same content. Need a quick summary in Spanish, a detailed English briefing, and a casual French overview? Done in minutes. This boosts accessibility, global reach, and audience engagement with zero extra recording effort. - [03:25:03 → 03:52:57] **Video Overviews with Nano Banana Pro Visual Styles: The Artistic AI Revolution** Generate narrated video slideshows in six unique art styles (watercolor, anime, papercraft, etc.) fro