d share results in the community for feedback. Testimonials show real users saving time and growing businesses with AI automation. - [00:30:40] **AI Profit Boardroom Community Benefits** Access to coaching, support, templates, and frameworks. Focused training on building school communities, AI avatar cloning, Twitter/X automation, and productivity systems. Daily accountability and direct access to experts. - [00:49:21] **SEO with Notebook LM and Gemini Integration** Content created in Notebook LM ranks well on Google and YouTube, often multiple times from the same video or blog post. The system includes exact match domains for SEO lead generation funnels, integrating AI-generated content and landing pages. - [01:00:09] **Notebook LM Ultra: The Power User Upgrade** Part of Google’s AI Ultra subscription, Notebook LM Ultra offers: - Access to Gemini’s best AI models for faster, deeper reasoning - Massive source limits: 600 sources per notebook (vs. 50 free, 300 pro) - Increased output limits (audio, video, research sessions) - Watermark-free, professional slide decks and infographics - Ability to create long-form, detailed slide decks for lectures and workshops Ultra is perfect for researchers, content creators, business analysts, and students handling heavy workloads. - [01:08:10] **10,000 Character Custom Prompt Limit: Build Detailed Personas** Notebook LM expanded its custom prompt length from 500 to 10,000 characters, allowing users to create highly detailed personas like: - Ruthless product manager with decision memos - Middle school teacher breaking down complex concepts with quizzes - Scientific researcher providing PhD-level academic analysis This enables accurate, context-grounded AI assistants tailored for specific roles and industries. - [01:16:53] **Use Cases for Custom Personas** Content creators can build script reviewers; students can generate exam tutors; business pros can find contradictions in reports. Grounding answers in uploaded documents eliminat