dwritten notes, textbook pages, whiteboards, screenshots—and extracts text and data using OCR. You can query these images as if they were typed documents. - [02:32:52] **Deep Research and Discover Tools** These tools automatically find relevant web sources based on your queries, fetching articles, data, and studies to augment your notebooks, consolidating all research in one place. - [02:36:08] **Limitations and Best Practices for Image Uploads** OCR accuracy depends on image quality and handwriting clarity. Users should verify extracted text. Privacy considerations are important since processing happens in the cloud. - [02:39:53] **Personal Research Libraries and Cross-Source Queries** You can build a searchable knowledge base combining images, PDFs, web sources, and notes, enabling complex queries that pull insights across all your materials. - [03:00:05] **Deep Research with Citation and Source Tracking** Notebook LM provides detailed, cited research reports pulling from dozens of sources, with linked references for credibility and further exploration. - [03:03:01] **Step-By-Step SEO Video Content Creation Workflow** Seven prompts transform PDFs and documents into full video scripts, SEO-optimized titles, metadata, YouTube chapters, shorts scripts, and social media captions—creating a complete content marketing machine. - [03:11:26] **Native LaTeX Rendering for Math and Science Studying** Notebook LM now displays math equations and formulas cleanly across chat, flashcards, and quizzes, replacing messy code with textbook-quality formatting, improving study efficiency and accuracy. - [03:18:11] **Multiple Audio Overview Versions per Notebook (Studio Design)** Generate multiple audio narrations of the same content in different languages, tones, and lengths using Notebook LM’s new studio interface. Great for reaching diverse audiences and team training. - [03:25:29] **Combining Notebook LM with Perplexity AI for Content Automation** Use Perplexity AI for up-to-date w