hool teachers, scientific researchers, - Ground all responses in your uploaded documents—no hallucinations, - Perfect for business professionals, educators, students, researchers, content creators. Julian demos the three personas with live examples, showcasing how each can produce expert-level, tailored output with proper citations. Custom personas enable: - SEO auditors, - Legal contract analyzers, - Budget analysts, - Content reviewers, - Exam prep tutors, - Contradiction finders for business reports. Tips: - Upload sources before chatting, - Use specific, detailed prompts for best results, - Adapt Google’s sample persona prompts for your needs. This feature turns Notebook LM into personalized AI experts trained on your own data. --- #### - [01:18:12 → 01:38:02] Visual Content Creation with Nano Banana Pro Google integrated **Nano Banana Pro**, their Gemini 3 image model, into Notebook LM, enabling: - Automatic generation of professional-quality **infographics and slide decks** from your uploaded documents, - Accurate visuals like charts, timelines, icons that reflect your content, - Customizable colors, fonts, layouts, and export options (PDF, Google Slides, images), - Six unique video overview styles (watercolor, papercraft, anime, etc.) for narrated videos, - The ability to create multiple content formats from one knowledge base (audio, video, slides, infographics). Julian demonstrates creating social media-ready infographics and full presentations in minutes, emphasizing the ease of use and professional quality. Use cases: - Students create visual study guides, - Educators prepare lecture slides, - Businesses build client presentations and marketing assets, - Agencies create reports and infographics quickly. He notes this eliminates the need for designers or advanced software and dramatically cuts production time. --- #### - [01:38:02 → 01:52:34] Automation in Action: Building Systems & Community Support Julian showcases live examples of generating podcasts, i